**/node_modules
apps
# The server image builds the browser client from the desktop's renderer (hosted edition spec §17.6).
# Only what `build:browser` reads comes back: never the desktop's node_modules, native bindings,
# build output or anything else beside them.
!apps/desktop/package.json
!apps/desktop/vite.browser.config.ts
!apps/desktop/tsconfig*.json
!apps/desktop/src
docs-site
e2e
git-worktrees
**/dist
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.superpowers
coverage
release
# After every negation above, so none of them can bring these back.
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
